artifacts:
  - $route/7.1.acuity.envelope.emergency.yield.md

reviews:
  self:
    - slug: has-envelope-not-mode
      say: |
        is the emergency floor set by the most time-critical LIVE scenario (the
        envelope), not by the most probable one? acuity set by the modal
        scenario instead of the worst-case bound is a blocker.
    - slug: has-redline-signs
      say: |
        are the red-line go-now signs concrete and drawn from the worst-case
        bounds? a floor with no observable trigger cannot be acted on.
